# Repo-wide ignores.
# Build artifacts and IDE files are handled by Auth/.gitignore — gitignore
# files cascade into subdirectories, so we do not duplicate them here.

### Secrets — never commit these (security rule #7) ###
.env
*.env
!.env.example

### IDE (root level — Auth/ has its own) ###
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

### Logs ###
*.log

### Per-machine tool settings (not project source) ###
.claude/settings.local.json

### OS junk ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
